  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0: new optional alerts (AddAutoMappingAlerts) for error rate, slow mapping, slow compile, GC pressure, cache growth, suspected memory leak and failing report delivery; sinks: log, signed webhook, email (SMTP) and callback; no change to mapping or reporting code. 3.0.0: benchmarks re-measured on .NET 8 and .NET 10 against AutoMapper (time, speed-up, memory tables); README rewritten with quick start and feature table; release notes added. No change to the mapping engine since 2.0.0. 2.0.0: package renamed to FastSI.AutoMapping (namespace unchanged); faster collection mapping; LICENSE and icon included. Full history: CHANGELOG.md.",
